{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"mechanics-lesson01","version":1,"title":"解析力学","subtitle":"第1回 · 第1回資料・平面極座標","scope":"kaiseki_2026_fall_01.pdf、全12ページ。ニュートンの法則、デカルト座標と平面極座標の速度・加速度・運動方程式。","sourceManifest":[{"file":"Kyoto_Univ/[2026後期水２]解析力学（数理）/授業資料/kaiseki_2026_fall_01.pdf","sha256":"17dceea90bd772016b2575353a0dc40b7cd26c1dd13a6522abdd0a66c1d4f086","pageCount":12,"reviewedPages":[5,6,9,10,11,12],"method":"原資料の該当ページ画像を目視し、問題・解答・条件を照らし合わせた。画像ファイルは1枚を1ページとする。"}],"questions":[{"id":"mechanics-l01-q01","version":1,"prompt":"慣性系とは、自由な質点の運動についてどんな法則が成り立つ座標系？","answer":"力を受けない質点が静止または等速直線運動をする座標系。","criterion":"力が0なら静止または等速直線運動と言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"kaiseki_2026_fall_01.pdf","page":5,"imageKey":"17dceea90bd772016b2575353a0dc40b7cd26c1dd13a6522abdd0a66c1d4f086:5"}],"promptHtml":"慣性系とは、自由な質点の運動についてどんな法則が成り立つ座標系？","answerHtml":"力を受けない質点が静止または等速直線運動をする座標系。","criterionHtml":"力が0なら静止または等速直線運動と言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"mechanics-l01-q02","version":1,"prompt":"慣性系で、質量一定の質点の位置を\\(\\boldsymbol r(t)\\)、合力を\\(\\boldsymbol F\\)、質量を\\(m\\)とする。ニュートンの運動方程式は？","answer":"\\(m\\ddot{\\boldsymbol r}=\\boldsymbol F\\)。","criterion":"質量×位置の2階時間微分＝合力と書ければ正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"kaiseki_2026_fall_01.pdf","page":6,"imageKey":"17dceea90bd772016b2575353a0dc40b7cd26c1dd13a6522abdd0a66c1d4f086:6"}],"promptHtml":"慣性系で、質量一定の質点の位置を<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol r(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span>、合力を<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol F</annotation></semantics></math></span>、質量を<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span>とする。ニュートンの運動方程式は？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">r</mi><mo>¨</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m\\ddot{\\boldsymbol r}=\\boldsymbol F</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"質量×位置の2階時間微分＝合力と書ければ正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"mechanics-l01-q03","version":1,"prompt":"平面極座標\\((r,\\theta)\\)で、\\(\\theta\\)をx軸から測るとき、デカルト座標\\((x,y)\\)との関係は？","answer":"\\(x=r\\cos\\theta\\)、\\(y=r\\sin\\theta\\)。","criterion":"xにcos、yにsinが対応すれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"kaiseki_2026_fall_01.pdf","page":9,"imageKey":"17dceea90bd772016b2575353a0dc40b7cd26c1dd13a6522abdd0a66c1d4f086:9"}],"promptHtml":"平面極座標<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(r,\\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span>で、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span>をx軸から測るとき、デカルト座標<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x,y)</annotation></semantics></math></span>との関係は？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=r\\cos\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=r\\sin\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"xにcos、yにsinが対応すれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"mechanics-l01-q04","version":1,"prompt":"平面極座標の位置ベクトルが\\(\\boldsymbol r=r\\boldsymbol e_r\\)。動径方向・角度方向の単位ベクトルを\\(\\boldsymbol e_r,\\boldsymbol e_\\theta\\)とすると、速度は？","answer":"\\(\\boldsymbol v=\\dot r\\boldsymbol e_r+r\\dot\\theta\\boldsymbol e_\\theta\\)。","criterion":"動径成分がrの時間微分、角度成分がr×角速度と言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"kaiseki_2026_fall_01.pdf","page":10,"imageKey":"17dceea90bd772016b2575353a0dc40b7cd26c1dd13a6522abdd0a66c1d4f086:10"}],"promptHtml":"平面極座標の位置ベクトルが<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">e</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol r=r\\boldsymbol e_r</annotation></semantics></math></span>。動径方向・角度方向の単位ベクトルを<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">e</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">e</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol e_r,\\boldsymbol e_\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span>とすると、速度は？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>r</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">e</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">e</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol v=\\dot r\\boldsymbol e_r+r\\dot\\theta\\boldsymbol e_\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"動径成分がrの時間微分、角度成分がr×角速度と言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"mechanics-l01-q05","version":1,"prompt":"平面極座標\\((r(t),\\theta(t))\\)で、加速度の動径方向成分\\(a_r\\)は？ドットは時間微分を表す。","answer":"\\(a_r=\\ddot r-r\\dot\\theta^2\\)。","criterion":"rの2階微分からr×角速度の2乗を引くと言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"kaiseki_2026_fall_01.pdf","page":10,"imageKey":"17dceea90bd772016b2575353a0dc40b7cd26c1dd13a6522abdd0a66c1d4f086:10"}],"promptHtml":"平面極座標<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(r(t),\\theta(t))</annotation></semantics></math></span>で、加速度の動径方向成分<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_r</annotation></semantics></math></span>は？ドットは時間微分を表す。","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>r</mi><mo>¨</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi><msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_r=\\ddot r-r\\dot\\theta^2</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"rの2階微分からr×角速度の2乗を引くと言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"mechanics-l01-q06","version":1,"prompt":"平面極座標\\((r(t),\\theta(t))\\)で、加速度の角度方向成分\\(a_\\theta\\)は？ドットは時間微分を表す。","answer":"\\(a_\\theta=2\\dot r\\dot\\theta+r\\ddot\\theta\\)。","criterion":"2ṙθ̇とrθ̈の両方を含めれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"kaiseki_2026_fall_01.pdf","page":10,"imageKey":"17dceea90bd772016b2575353a0dc40b7cd26c1dd13a6522abdd0a66c1d4f086:10"}],"promptHtml":"平面極座標<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(r(t),\\theta(t))</annotation></semantics></math></span>で、加速度の角度方向成分<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span>は？ドットは時間微分を表す。","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>r</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>¨</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_\\theta=2\\dot r\\dot\\theta+r\\ddot\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"2ṙθ̇とrθ̈の両方を含めれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"mechanics-l01-q07","version":1,"prompt":"慣性系の平面極座標で、質量一定の質点に働く動径方向の力を\\(F_r\\)とする。動径方向の運動方程式は？","answer":"\\(m(\\ddot r-r\\dot\\theta^2)=F_r\\)。","criterion":"動径方向加速度全体にmを掛けてFᵣに等しくすれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"kaiseki_2026_fall_01.pdf","page":11,"imageKey":"17dceea90bd772016b2575353a0dc40b7cd26c1dd13a6522abdd0a66c1d4f086:11"}],"promptHtml":"慣性系の平面極座標で、質量一定の質点に働く動径方向の力を<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_r</annotation></semantics></math></span>とする。動径方向の運動方程式は？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>r</mi><mo>¨</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi><msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m(\\ddot r-r\\dot\\theta^2)=F_r</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"動径方向加速度全体にmを掛けてFᵣに等しくすれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"mechanics-l01-q08","version":1,"prompt":"ニュートンの運動方程式をデカルト座標から極座標へ書き換えると、成分の式の形は変わる？","answer":"変わる。ベクトルとしての法則は同じでも、成分表示は座標系に依存する。","criterion":"成分表示の形は変わると言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"kaiseki_2026_fall_01.pdf","page":6,"imageKey":"17dceea90bd772016b2575353a0dc40b7cd26c1dd13a6522abdd0a66c1d4f086:6"},{"file":"kaiseki_2026_fall_01.pdf","page":12,"imageKey":"17dceea90bd772016b2575353a0dc40b7cd26c1dd13a6522abdd0a66c1d4f086:12"}],"promptHtml":"ニュートンの運動方程式をデカルト座標から極座標へ書き換えると、成分の式の形は変わる？","answerHtml":"変わる。ベクトルとしての法則は同じでも、成分表示は座標系に依存する。","criterionHtml":"成分表示の形は変わると言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""}],"sourceImages":{"17dceea90bd772016b2575353a0dc40b7cd26c1dd13a6522abdd0a66c1d4f086:5":"./assets/sources/17dceea90bd772016b2575353a0dc40b7cd26c1dd13a6522abdd0a66c1d4f086-5.png","17dceea90bd772016b2575353a0dc40b7cd26c1dd13a6522abdd0a66c1d4f086:6":"./assets/sources/17dceea90bd772016b2575353a0dc40b7cd26c1dd13a6522abdd0a66c1d4f086-6.png","17dceea90bd772016b2575353a0dc40b7cd26c1dd13a6522abdd0a66c1d4f086:9":"./assets/sources/17dceea90bd772016b2575353a0dc40b7cd26c1dd13a6522abdd0a66c1d4f086-9.png","17dceea90bd772016b2575353a0dc40b7cd26c1dd13a6522abdd0a66c1d4f086:10":"./assets/sources/17dceea90bd772016b2575353a0dc40b7cd26c1dd13a6522abdd0a66c1d4f086-10.png","17dceea90bd772016b2575353a0dc40b7cd26c1dd13a6522abdd0a66c1d4f086:11":"./assets/sources/17dceea90bd772016b2575353a0dc40b7cd26c1dd13a6522abdd0a66c1d4f086-11.png","17dceea90bd772016b2575353a0dc40b7cd26c1dd13a6522abdd0a66c1d4f086:12":"./assets/sources/17dceea90bd772016b2575353a0dc40b7cd26c1dd13a6522abdd0a66c1d4f086-12.png"},"renderVersion":1}